        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: 20th Century Fox\n- Products: The Ghost and Mrs. Muir\n- Places: United Kingdom, Century City, Los Angeles, Beverly Hills\n- Topics: film rights, major American film studios\n\nFacts:\n- In 1945, 20th Century Fox bought the film rights to The Ghost and Mrs. Muir.\n- At that time, The Ghost and Mrs. Muir had been published only in the United Kingdom.\n- 20th Century Fox is one of the \"Big Six\" major American film studios.\n- 20th Century Fox is located in the Century City area of Los Angeles, just west of Beverly Hills.",
